{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェキ会の当落がもう出てるみたいですが\nみんなどうだったー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田のとこに来てくださるかた\n楽しみにしてるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/10/5534946/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は生写真撮影と取材がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーの歌衣装\nめっちゃ可愛かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/10/5534946/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブとかで着れるのかな？\n早く着たい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとは雨の中\n美容院に駆け込みで行って\nトリートメントしたり\n綺麗にしてもらってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/10/5534946/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美容院行く日に限って\n雨めっちゃ降るんだよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/10/5534946/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7割がた降ってる(;o;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま、ライブとか仕事とかで\nなんやかんや行く機会を逃してたから\n行けて良かった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/10/5534946/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『乃木坂46西武ドーム公演の裏側を松村、中田が解説』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://news.dwango.jp/index.php?itemid=17948"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西武ドームについて語りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わって早々！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西武ドーム来てくださったかたも\nスカパー!の生中継を見てくださったかたも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなことがあったのか～ふむふむ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなる記事になってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/10/5534946/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでねー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/03/10/5534946/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}